	quest.3B36D92C11DA3BB8.quest_desc: ["There is FTB Chunks in this pack, to use it simply open your map with &6M&r, then in the top left there is a &aClaimed Chunks&r icon, or you could simply press &6C&r. \\n\\nTo claim a chunk, left click and drag to claim.\\n\\nTo force load a chunk, shift-left click the chunk. If done properly, you'll see lines across the chunk."]
